sort [l_shipmode asc]
└─ project (l_shipmode, high_line_count, low_line_count) (rows≈1 cost≈5.1K)
   └─ aggregate keys=[l_shipmode] aggs=[sum_0=sum, sum_1=sum] (rows≈1 cost≈5.1K)
      └─ project (l_shipmode, arg_0, arg_1) (rows≈1 cost≈5.1K)
         └─ join inner [lineitem.l_orderkey = orders.o_orderkey] emit-filter 1 from left (rows≈1 cost≈5K)
            ├─ filter (&& (&& (&& (&& (call qdb_in_list |lineitem.l_shipmode| (cast "TRUCK" <named StringView>) (cast "AIR" <named StringView>)) (< |lineitem.l_commitdate| |lineitem.l_receiptdate|)) (< |lineitem.l_shipdate| |lineitem.l_commitdate|)) (>= |lineitem.l_receiptdate| (: 8401 i32))) (< |lineitem.l_receiptdate| (+ (: 8401 i32) (: 365 i32)))) (rows≈1 cost≈640)
            │  └─ source lineitem AS lineitem row-groups (&& (&& (&& (< |lineitem.l_commitdate| |lineitem.l_receiptdate|) (< |lineitem.l_shipdate| |lineitem.l_commitdate|)) (&& (>= |lineitem.l_receiptdate| (: 8401 i32)) (< |lineitem.l_receiptdate| (+ (: 8401 i32) (: 365 i32))))) (call qdb_in_list |lineitem.l_shipmode| (cast "TRUCK" <named StringView>) (cast "AIR" <named StringView>))) (rows≈10 cost≈320)
            └─ source orders AS orders use-filter 1 keys=[orders.o_orderkey] (rows≈10 cost≈200)
